+# Activities
+
+Activities represent events and actions that have taken place across boards in the account, mirroring the account activity timeline.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities.json`
+
+Returns a paginated list of activities you have access to, ordered newest first. Results can be filtered using query parameters.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by event creator ID(s) |
+| `page` | Page number for pagination |
+
+__Event Actions:__
+
+- `card_assigned` - Card assigned to user(s)
+- `card_unassigned` - Card unassigned from user(s)
+- `card_published` - Card created and published
+- `card_closed` - Card closed (moved to Done)
+- `card_reopened` - Card reopened
+- `card_board_changed` - Card moved to another board
+- `card_postponed` - Card moved to Not Now
+- `card_auto_postponed` - Card automatically moved to Not Now due to inactivity
+- `card_triaged` - Card triaged into a workflow column
+- `card_sent_back_to_triage` - Card moved back to triage
+- `card_title_changed` - Card title renamed
+- `comment_created` - Comment added to a card
+
+__Particulars:__
+
+The `particulars` object contains event-specific details:
+- Assignment changes contain `assignee_ids`
+- Board changes contain `old_board` and `new_board`
+- Title changes contain `old_title` and `new_title`
+- Triage events contain `column`
+- Other events return an empty `{}` object
+
+Missing board, title, or column values are returned as empty strings.
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+    "action": "card_assigned",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+    "description": "David assigned JZ to \"Layout is broken\"",
+    "particulars": {
+      "assignee_ids": ["03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"]
+    },
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/1",
+    "eventable_type": "Card",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5vaeq985jlvwv3arl4srq2",
+      "number": 1,
+      "title": "Layout is broken",
+      "status": "published",
+      "description": "The layout is broken on mobile devices",
+      "description_html": "<div>The layout is broken on mobile devices</div>",
+      "image_url": null,
+      "has_attachments": false,
+      "tags": [],
+      "closed": false,
+      "postponed": false,
+      "golden": false,
+      "last_active_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/1",
+      "board": { ... },
+      "creator": { ... },
+      "assignees": [ ... ],
+      "has_more_assignees": false,
+      "comments_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/1/comments",
+      "reactions_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/1/reactions"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcy",
+      "name": "Writebook",
+      "all_access": true,
+      "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+      "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+      "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcy",
+      "creator": { ... }
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
